  "description": "RESTEasy contains a JBoss project that provides frameworks to help build RESTful Web Services and RESTful Java applications. It is a fully certified and portable implementation of the JAX-RS specification.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * resteasy-core: RESTEasy: IIOImageProvider Unbounded Image Decode (Decompression-Bomb DoS) (CVE-2026-89059)\n  * resteasy-core: RESTEasy: CorsFilter Reflects Arbitrary Origin with Credentials under Wildcard Config (CVE-2026-89058)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
